+ * advance_active) in a single pass over the active list.
+ *
+ * add_span_aa(x0, x1) adds the same deltas as adding a point at x0 and
+ * subtracting one at x1 (see add_point_aa). So rather than branching on
+ * where the spans start and end, which depends on the shape and is hard to
+ * predict, every edge adds its point with a weight of +1 (a span starts
